      "text": "SEIBERG-WITTEN PREPOTENTIAL FROM INSTANTON COUNTING — 24 sections: Front matter; Jourdain:; Introduction\n\n**SEIBERG-WITTEN PREPOTENTIAL FROM INSTANTON COUNTING**\n\n*Institut des Hautes Etudes Scientifiques, Le Bois-Marie, Bures-sur-Yvette, F-91440 France*\n\n31 pp, 24 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; M Jourdain:; 1 Introduction; 2 Field theory expectations; 2.1 Supersymmetries and twisted supersymmetrie; Field; 2.2 Good observables: UV; 2.3 Good observables: IR; 3 Instanton measure and its localization; 3.1 ADHM data; 3.2 Instanton measure; 3.3 Curing non-compactness; 3.4 Reduction to contour integrals; 3.5 Classiﬁcation of the residues; 3.6 Residues and ﬁxed points; 3.7 The ﬁrst three nonabelian instantons; 3.8 Four and ﬁve instantons; 3.9 Adjoint matter and other matters",
